  "description": "The EVRYjourney Men’s 500W Deluxe is built for comfort, confidence, and range. A front suspension fork smooths out rough streets and path chatter, while an upright, ergonomic frame with forward-pedaling geometry reduces strain on your back, hips, shoulders, and knees. Integrated front and rear lights increase visibility day and night, so you can commute, cruise, or explore with added peace of mind.\n\nBike-only for a traditional workout.\n\nPedal Assist when you want a boost on hills or longer rides.\n\nThumb Throttle when you’d rather let the motor handle the effort.\n\nYou choose the effort; the EVRYjourney delivers a smooth, predictable assist.\n\nComfort-first design\n\nThe relaxed, upright posture and forward-pedaling setup keep you lower to the ground for easy stops while still giving full leg extension when pedaling. The suspension fork and stable 26\" wheels with semi-slick tires provide a cushioned, confident ride on neighborhood streets, bike paths, and light trails.\n\nBattery: ~500 Wh; approx. 20 miles full-electric, 20–40 miles on pedal assist (rider weight, terrain, and usage affect range)\n\nBrakes: Front and rear disc hand brakes for reliable stopping power",
